## Description

The `toJSON()` method is automatically called by JSON.stringify() when a `Temporal.PlainTime` object is stringified. This method is generally intended to, by default, usefully serialize `Temporal.PlainTime` objects during [JSON](/en-US/docs/Glossary/JSON) serialization, which can then be deserialized using the {{jsxref("Temporal/PlainTime/from", "Temporal.PlainTime.from()")}} function within the reviver of JSON.parse().

